  "description": "<p data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"543\"><strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"205\">Product Description</strong><br data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"208\" />Our <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"242\">Woven Rattan Dolphin Shape</strong> is a beautiful example of Vietnamese artistry, combining the charm of natural rattan with the skill of traditional weaving. Each dolphin is carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam, making it a unique and eco-friendly decorative piece for homes, resorts, hotels, or beach-themed spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"782\">Made from sustainably sourced rattan, this dolphin-shaped decor is lightweight yet durable, offering a warm, natural texture. It’s perfect for wall hanging, shelf display, or as part of coastal, tropical, and nautical interior designs.</p>\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"1028\">By choosing this product, you’re supporting Vietnam’s traditional craft villages—helping to create jobs for rural communities, generate valuable foreign currency for the country, and preserve cultural heritage through sustainable handicrafts.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1048\"><strong data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1046\">Key Features</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<li data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1095\">\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1095\">100% natural rattan, sustainably harvested</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1139\">\n<p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1139\">Handmade by skilled Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1201\">\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1201\">Unique dolphin shape – ideal for beach and coastal themes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1244\">\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1244\">Lightweight, durable, and eco-friendly</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1297\">\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1297\">Suitable for home decor, resorts, and gift shops</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1354\">\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1354\">OEM &amp; ODM orders accepted – direct from manufacturer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1407\">Factory, supplier, and exporter based in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1685\"><strong data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1434\">Contact for Wholesale</strong><br data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1437\" />We are a trusted <strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1512\">rattan handicraft manufacturer and exporter in Vietnam</strong>, supplying high-quality woven decor worldwide.<br data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1562\" />📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1595\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1598\" />📱 WhatsApp: +84-975810168<br data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1627\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1683\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
